        "subject": "Access wording: no business is told it is waiting for approval (2026-10-24)",
        "body": "Access wording: no business is told it is waiting for approval (2026-10-24)\n\nThe owner's binding clarification: redeeming a platform-issued Owner setup code activates\nthe Owner at once; approval and commercial entitlement are separate; a business without a\nsubscription or grant is shown an accurate access-required state, never \"waiting for\napproval\".\n\n- Portal: the `pending` state reads \"No access yet\" and explains that the business has no\n  active subscription or access grant yet (EN/FR/AR).\n- Console: the subscription status `pending_activation` reads \"No access yet\" in the\n  businesses list and the queue (EN/FR/AR).\n- The public sign-up confirmation (`apply.done.body`) is untouched: public registration is\n  closed, and the public site is out of this phase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KgTdKL8Zio1HYmBzKGBuAY\n",
